          "rationale": "The probe handles no credentials.",
          "reopensOnly": "This row reopens if, and only if, TASK-260715-1jckn0 gains a deliverable in which the probe host writes a credential that the probe appex must read back, with its own acceptance criterion and evidence. Today the probe stores no credential: its scope is the NETunnelProviderManager lifecycle and a versioned app message, and its provider protocol carries no secret. It does NOT reopen merely because the production iOS pair shares a group - under rule G4's probeRule a probe inherits identifiers and profile classes, never entitlements.",
          "decidedBy": "TASK-260715-ypo7yo r5, on reviewer verdict 04 F1 (rule K2, applied to every withheld row rather than only the one the finding named)"
        },
        "com.apple.security.app-sandbox": {
          "status": "not-applicable",
          "portalCapability": false,
          "requirementSource": "platform-inherent",
          "requirementBasis": "iOS apps are always sandboxed.",
          "rationale": "Not an authored key on iOS."
        }
      }
