      "excludedJsonNote": "Two kinds. Append-only history — revisionLog and the `history` / `staleClaimsFound` fields — where a past count is a true historical statement, exactly as rule A1 excludes `notes` and rule S1 excludes revisionLog from its own scan. And this rule's own register, because `claims` and `coverageScan` necessarily contain the templates and the excluded phrases the scan is looking for; a rule that flagged its own definition could never pass.",
