stated reopening condition), `prohibited-pending-decision` (withheld now,
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `…temporary-exception.mach-lookup.global-name` | `macos.host` | `-spks`, `-spki` | Sparkle installer launcher (ADR-018) |

