.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1768:      "id": "OC-1",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1771:      "corroboration": "Observed 2026-07-28 on this Mac. (a) Two shipping Developer ID packet-tunnel system extensions ship com.apple.security.temporary-exception.files.absolute-path.read-write entries for /private/var/root/Library/Group Containers/ (Tailscale, Surfshark) — direct evidence that a root provider's group container is not the user's. (b) Surfshark's provider carries a temporary-exception path for /Library/Keychains/, i.e. the FILE-BASED System keychain, not the Data Protection Keychain. (c) PureVPN's providers carry keychain-access-groups outright. Together these indicate the real-world macOS pattern is a file-based/System keychain or an IPC seed, not a shared Data Protection Keychain access group.",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1786:      "id": "OC-2",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1798:      "id": "OC-3",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1808:      "id": "OC-4",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1817:      "newEvidenceR4": "Read at /System/Library/Sandbox/Profiles/application.sb on macOS 26.5 (25F71): application.sb:326-328 builds the authorized prefix as (global-name-prefix (string-append suite \".\")) where suite is the literal entitlement value, whatever its style. On the SANDBOX side the mechanism is therefore style-agnostic, and an iOS-style group.works.relux.tunnel would yield the prefix 'group.works.relux.tunnel.'. This is evidence, not proof: the launchd bootstrap-registration side and the profile-authorization side were not exercised, and nothing was signed. Recorded so a future revival of the XPC channel starts from what is known rather than from the r3 statement that no source addressed it at all.",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1868:    "TASK-260728-7ii1xz — macOS credential transport (OC-1, OC-4)",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1869:    "TASK-260715-29ws8l — profile trust and credential contract (OC-1; its AC2 and AC4 specify the App Group snapshot and the Keychain access group that rules G4 and K2 decide)",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1870:    "TASK-260715-2hhh7x — profile key and ownership contract (OC-1)",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1877:    "surveyBasis": "The entitlement's macOS effect is not a matter of opinion: it is two sandbox-array-entitlement blocks in the system App Sandbox profile. Both were read in full at /System/Library/Sandbox/Profiles/application.sb on macOS 26.5 (25F71) rather than inferred from documentation. They are the only two occurrences of the key in that profile.",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1881:        "sandboxProfileLines": "application.sb:305-315",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1885:        "note": "The group container itself. The host resolves it under the logged-in user's home, the root provider under /private/var/root, so it is not a shared container on macOS. Directly corroborated: two shipping packet-tunnel system extensions on this Mac ship temporary-exception.files.absolute-path.read-write entries for /private/var/root/Library/Group Containers/, which is what you author when you need to cross that boundary."
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1889:        "sandboxProfileLines": "application.sb:307-314",
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1893:        "note": "UNIX-domain sockets inside the group container. Same home-relative defect. It is also redundant for private use: application.sb:754-756 already allows network-bind and network-outbound on the target's OWN container with no entitlement at all."
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_apple-identifier-entitlement-matrix.json:1897:        "sandboxProfileLines": "application.sb:316-321",
